# --- AI providers (study server functions) ---
# At least ONE of the following must be set, otherwise AI calls fail with
# "AI is not configured yet." / "AI providers are unavailable".
# Tried in this order on /api/study:
#   Gemini (GEMINI_API_KEY or GOOGLE_API_KEY)
#   -> Lovable gateway (LOVABLE_API_KEY, injected by Lovable Cloud)
#   -> Groq (GROQ_API_KEY) — models: openai/gpt-oss-120b, openai/gpt-oss-20b
#   -> Grok / xAI (GROK_API_KEY or XAI_API_KEY)
# The shared Lovable gateway returns HTTP 402 when credits run out. When that
# happens the personal keys above take over automatically — set at least one.
# NOTE: put real secrets in .env.local (gitignored), not here — this file is
# committed. Both old (AIza...) and new (AQ....) Google AI Studio keys work.
# Free Gemini key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Free Groq key:   https://console.groq.com/keys
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
GROK_API_KEY=
XAI_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
